.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-staff-delete - Delete a staff member


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit staff delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete the staff member's LLDAP identity. The Stalwart mailbox, messages, and forwarding remain, but Keycloak browser sign-in and LLDAP-backed mail authentication stop. This command does not remove the imported Keycloak profile or validate migration backups; use the reviewed identity-reset procedure for a full reset.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--owner-store\fP=""
	path to owner.json vault

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	staff server URL (or ORBIT_STAFF_URL)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-staff(1)\fP
